<title>USA: REITs seen as clear bet in murky market - NYTimes.</title>
<headline>REITs seen as clear bet in murky market - NYTimes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real estate investment trusts (REITs) are a sound investment when the overall health of financial markets is in question, analysts said in an article appearing in the Sunday editions of the New York Times business section.</p>
<p>The stocks are good investments because they offer high dividend yields, the article said.</p>
<p>REITs mentioned as good stock picks included Starwood Lodging, Crescent Real Estate Equities, Mills Corp and Bay Apartment Communities.</p>
